{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">重慶涪陵早前舉辦花海燈會，由上百名綵燈匠人純手工打造的68組非遺自貢綵燈，錯落分布在山林與湖畔之間，交融成一幅色彩斑斕的畫卷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CQ.LANTERN.MTV.0822-0902_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026SY55Zt3FtH1788312530.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CQ.LANTERN.MTV.0822-0902_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T01:43:57.336270+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":63,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}